1. The National Intergrated Local Government Services (NILGS) system will centralize and automate the
 issuance of key local government documents, which are indigenization letters, birth and death certificates,
 and marriage certificates. The system will be deployed across Nigeria’s Local Government Areas (LGAs) and will
 be accessible to citizens, LGA administrators, regional consultants, agents, and central government bodies.
  Barnksforte Technologies Limited (BTL) is responsible for the system design, development, deployment,
  and maintenance.